Third-party material
--------------------

AutoEq — https://github.com/jaakkopasanen/AutoEq
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018-2022 Jaakko Pasanen.
  Joseon embeds measured headphone frequency responses and target curves taken from
  AutoEq (`Sources/JoseonHeadphones/EmbeddedCurves.swift`). Most measurements were made
  by oratory1990. Full license text, file list and measurers: docs/third-party-autoeq.md.

Headphone sensitivity figures are facts cited from manufacturer data sheets. The
diffuse-field offset comes from Hammershøi & Møller (2008), DOI 10.3813/AAA.918014.
Sources: docs/third-party-sensitivity.md.

